21867888,2026-05-04,Debt collection,Medical debt,Written notification about debt,Didn't receive enough information to verify debt,"I am submitting this complaint regarding a medical account that was referred to collections without proper billing or validation. 

On or about XX/XX/year>, I contacted the provider to address the account. During that call, I was informed that no final bill had been issued. This was later confirmed by another representative the same day. 

On XX/XX/year>, I spoke with a representative who confirmed that a request had been submitted to Accounts Receivable to review the account and pull it back from collections due to the absence of a final bill. 

On XX/XX/year>, I spoke with another representative who stated that billing had in fact been sent, which directly contradicted the prior information I had received. During that call, I again explained that I had never received a final bill. I requested escalation and a callback from a supervisor. No callback was ever received despite multiple requests. 

Throughout this process, I repeatedly requested the following : - A complete itemized statement - Verification of all billing notices, including dates and delivery method - Clarification of why the account was referred to collections - A direct method to resolve the balance with the original provider To date, the debt remains unverified. 

As a result, I have been unable to verify the validity of the debt. Despite this, the account was referred to a third-party collection agency. 

I am willing to resolve any legitimate balance promptly. However, the provider has failed to provide basic billing documentation or consistent information regarding the account. 

This situation raises serious concerns about improper billing practices, lack of adequate notice, and the referral of an account to collections without proper validation. 

I am requesting that this account be reviewed, that full documentation be provided, and that the account be withdrawn from collections until proper validation is completed.",,"CMRE Financial Services, Inc.",CA,92116,,Web,2026-05-04,Closed with explanation,No
