t and that at my age I shouldve been paid it etc. I then spoke to the actual lease holder whose debt it belongs too and he even said it was weird that they put it on my name. He was the lease holder but got no debt for that apartment unit to which he was legally responsible for. The only way theres a lease with my name and signature is if fraud was committed by the staff. I was not physically living in that unit when he went to court and got evicted. Hes willing to speak on my behalf to the debt collection company but they keep hanging up on me to which I have left an voicemail with the supervisor to call me back regarding this matter. I do not owe timber ridge apartments and I need this removed and resolved immediately before I take legal action against them for filing an illegal claim of eviction on my name. Nobody will provide me with paperwork that will prove I was never on the lease or even on the lease for that matter. As of today, I have a debt collector attempting to collect a debt that does not belong to me.",,"National Credit Systems,Inc.",TX,77055,,Web,2026-05-06,Closed with explanation,Yes
